# Eaten by Piranhas on Bot2's Ornithopter (a colorless 0/2 Artifact Creature - Thopter with flying): it becomes a black Skeleton
# creature with base power and toughness 1/1 (layers 4, 5, 7b), loses the artifact type and the Thopter subtype with it
# (CR 205.1a, 613.1d - "loses all other card types and creature types"), and loses flying (layer 6). Cast with flash at
# Bot1's own turn is not needed here: it is a main-phase cast, but the Aura's flash is proved in the next scenario.

